{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026o1cledyTel1795038879.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>聯邦儲備局理事沃勒認為，若局方不釋放明年1月加息信號，12月應加息半厘。</p><p></p><p>沃勒表示，非常擔心通脹正朝著錯誤方向發展並不斷擴大，若聯儲局想降低通脹，需採取更強而有力的措施。擔心企業認為消費者具韌性，從而轉嫁百分之3或更高的價格升幅。</p><p></p><p>認為聯儲局可能要通過\"震懾\"市場，讓市場不再認為百分之3的通脹率是可以接受的目標，因此在加息方面需要更加積極。若局方不釋放明年1月加息信號，12月應加息半厘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T22:44:22.968409+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T20:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T00:57:17.221722+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T22:37:37.092949+00:00","content_hash":"4308ea6096e5d04460dfcb879ca6adc2f4835e2ce54c3af3346cf9592058639a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T22:44:22.968409+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}